  "prefLabel": "Agr 103.08 Division of Plant Industry",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 103.08 Division of Plant Industry. The division of plant industry shall inspect nursery and florist establishments, farms, agricultural crops and apiaries for insect, fungal or disease infection. It shall monitor insect and plant pests which might threaten crops, animals or human health.\n\nSource. #6012, eff 3-28-95",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/agr100.html"
